# Receipt Ledger runs without required environment variables.
# Copy this file to .env.local only when adding public Vite configuration.
#
# VITE_ variables are bundled into the browser and are visible to users.
# Do not put API keys, OCR service credentials, bank data, or receipt data here.
#
# Example public-only setting:
# VITE_RECEIPT_LEDGER_APP_NAME=Receipt Ledger
